/HopfProblem/blob/master/README.md\" data-discover=\"true\">README.md</a></p></div></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr id=\"folder-row-5\"><td colspan=\"2\"><div><p><a title=\"Solution.lean\" aria-label=\"Solution.lean, (File)\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/master/Solution.lean\" data-discover=\"true\">Solution.lean</a></p></div></td><td colspan=\"1\"><div><p><a title=\"Solution.lean\" aria-label=\"Solution.lean, (File)\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/master/Solution.lean\" data-discover=\"true\">Solution.lean</a></p></div></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr id=\"folder-row-6\"><td colspan=\"2\"><div><p><a title=\"lake-manifest.json\" aria-label=\"lake-manifest.json, (File)\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/master/lake-manifest.json\" data-discover=\"true\">lake-manifest.json</a></p></div></td><td colspan=\"1\"><div><p><a title=\"lake-manifest.json\" aria-label=\"lake-manifest.json, (File)\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/master/lake-manifest.json\" data-discover=\"true\">lake-manifest.json</a></p></div></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr id=\"folder-row-7\"><td colspan=\"2\"><div><p><a title=\"lakefile.toml\" aria-label=\"lakefile.toml, (File)\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/master/lakefile.toml\" data-discover=\"true\">lakefile.toml</a></p></div></td><td colspan=\"1\"><div><p><a title=\"lakefile.toml\" aria-label=\"lakefile.toml, (File)\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/master/lakefile.toml\" data-discover=\"true\">lakefile.toml</a></p></div></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr id=\"folder-row-8\"><td colspan=\"2\"><div><p><a title=\"lean-toolchain\" aria-label=\"lean-toolchain, (File)\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/master/lean-toolchain\" data-discover=\"true\">lean-toolchain</a></p></div></td><td colspan=\"1\"><div><p><a title=\"lean-toolchain\" aria-label=\"lean-toolchain, (File)\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/blob/master/lean-toolchain\" data-discover=\"true\">lean-toolchain</a></p></div></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr data-testid=\"view-all-files-row\"><td colspan=\"3\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><div itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/abstract\"><h2>Repository files navigation</h2><nav aria-label=\"Repository files\" data-variant=\"inset\" data-overflow-mode=\"wrap\" data-hide-icons-breakpoint=\"medium\"><ul role=\"list\"><li><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"page\"><span data-component=\"icon\"></span><span data-component=\"text\" data-content=\"README\">README</span></a></li><li><a href=\"#\"><span data-component=\"icon\"></span><span data-component=\"text\" data-content=\"License\">License</span></a></li></ul></nav></div><div data-hpc=\"true\" containertiming=\"hpc\"><article itemprop=\"text\">\n<p dir=\"auto\">The six-sphere admits a complex manifold structure compatible with its standard topology.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Based on <a href=\"https://alpo.ge/s6.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>A compact complex threefold fibred by tori over the projective line, and the six-sphere</em></a>, originally <a href=\"https://x.com/__alpoge__/status/2091639597193368014\" rel=\"nofollow\">shared on X</a> by <a href=\"https://alpo.ge/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Levent Alpöge</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The repository includes a Comparator setup, with the statement adapted from the <a href=\"https://github.com/google-deepmind/formal-conjectures/blob/main/FormalConjectures/Mathoverflow/1973.lean\">Formal Conjectures project</a>.</p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"lake update\nlake exe cache get\nlake build lean4export\nlake exe comparator comparator/config.json\"><pre>lake update\nlake exe cache get\nlake build lean4export\nlake exe comparator comparator/config.json</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://live.lean-lang.org/#project=mathlib-stable&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2Fplby%2FHopfProblem%2Frefs%2Fheads%2Fmaster%2FSolution.lean\" rel=\"nofollow\">Type-check it online!</a></p>\n</article></div></div></div></div><div data-component=\"SplitPageLayout.Pane\" data-is-hidden=\"false\" data-position=\"end\"><div><h2 data-variant=\"small\" data-component=\"Heading\"><span>About</span></h2><p data-component=\"Text\">A formalization of the resolution of the Hopf problem: the six-sphere admits a complex manifold structure compatible with its standard topology</p><h3 data-component=\"Heading\"><span>Resources</span></h3><p><a data-component=\"Link\" data-muted=\"true\" href=\"#readme-ov-file\"><span>Readme</span></a></p><p><a data-component=\"Link\" data-muted=\"true\" href=\"#License-1-ov-file\"><span>License</span></a></p><p><a data-component=\"Link\" data-muted=\"true\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/activity\" data-discover=\"true\"><span>Activity</span></a></p><h3 data-component=\"Heading\"><span>Stars</span></h3><p><span><strong>73</strong> stars</span></p><h3 data-component=\"Heading\"><span>Watchers</span></h3><p><span><strong>0</strong> watching</span></p><h3 data-component=\"Heading\"><span>Forks</span></h3><p><a data-component=\"Link\" data-muted=\"true\" href=\"https://github.com/plby/HopfProblem/forks\" data-discover=\"true\"><span><strong>5</strong></span><span> forks</span></a></p><div><p><a data-component=\"Link\" data-muted=\"true\" href=\"https://github.com/contact/report-content?content_url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fplby%2FHopfProblem&amp;report=plby+%28user%29\" data-discover=\"true\"><span>Report repository</span></a></p></div></div><div><h2 data-variant=\"small\" data-component=\"Heading\"><span>Releases</span></h2></div><div><h2 data-variant=\"small\" data-component=\"Heading\"><span>Packages</span></h2></div><div><h2 data-variant=\"small\" data-component=\"Heading\"><span>Contributors</span></h2></div><div><h2 data-variant=\"small\" data-component=\"Heading\"><span>Languages</span></h2></div></div></div></div>",
